# Track only the Godot port. Everything else in this tree is original
# game data, DOS/Win32 binaries, decompile output, notes or tooling —
# reproducible or copyrighted, not source.
/*
!/godot_project/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/COMMANDS.md
!/LICENSE
!/screenshots/
!/.github/

# Godot editor cache / imports
godot_project/.godot/

# Bundled original game data (copyrighted, 261 MB)
godot_project/gamedata/

# Android build artifacts (201 MB, regenerated by the export template)
godot_project/android/

# Stray logs
godot_project/*.log

# Converted-asset cache (rebuilt from gamedata/ on first start)
godot_project/converted/
godot_project/mods/

# Research tooling, not part of the port: a capstone driver for the
# original GAME.EXE. Needs the exe and the Ghidra output, neither of
# which is in this repo, so it cannot run from a clone. It stays on
# disk because docs/implementation_plan.md cites it.
godot_project/tools/x86dis.py
